Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:37.53,Header,,0,0,0,,ON METACRAFT
Dialogue: 1,0:00:00.00,0:00:11.22,Main,,0,0,0,,The instinct of the 20th-century artisan or patent attorney is to play it close to the chest: keep the trade secret, hide the repo, register the copyright, hoard the prompt.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:11.27,0:00:16.82,Main,,0,0,0,,In October 2026, that instinct is a corpse that has not realized it stopped breathing.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:16.87,0:00:20.80,Main,,0,0,0,,Frontier models have flattened the global cognitive gradient.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:20.85,0:00:34.09,Main,,0,0,0,,The knowledge required to make a spatial compiler, reverse an engine blob, or synthesize a living game world is not proprietary; it was already trained into the weights of Gemini, Claude, and their peers.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:34.14,0:00:37.53,Main,,0,0,0,,What was missing was only the harness and the hands.
